== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Sharp Key|Sharp Key]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, where it was less powerful, as killing enemies with it did not drop chest contents.
* This item can be considered to be the Key counterpart to {{i|Blood Bombs}}. Both items can use their respective pickups at the expense of another, with Sharp Key sacrificing Keys, while Blood Bombs sacrifices health.

